# cruiser_crew.layout — cruiser capture deck
#   Facing:            bow RIGHT (the rounded lobe), engines PORT (left prongs)
#   Far right:         Cockpit with ship console (C) — farthest from the breach
#   Port prong rooms:  Engine rooms (E strips) + engine loot
#   Center:            Spine hall along the sealed waist channel; piloting forward
#   Bottom center:     Enclosed breach stub (b) — spawn at P, exit > inside
#   Mid-forward:       Two-hatch airlock (a...a) to the exterior
#   Content:           role-token crew (doc 48 SETTLED 28) — the boarding
#                      hull's faction resolves the markers; one single-slot
#                      heavy anchors the deck; engine/storage/cargo/mess loot
